## Interface: 16001
#
# Named "_Mainline", not "_Forever": the Forever client reports
# WOW_PROJECT_ID as WOW_PROJECT_MAINLINE, so WoW's TOC-flavor selection
# only looks for "_Mainline" - a "_Forever"-suffixed file is confirmed to
# not load at all there (silently, no error). Do not rename this file.
# Still loads the Forever/ code tree (Classic content), not Retail.
## Version: 1.0.1
## Title: Mik's Scrolling Battle Text
## Author: Mikord
## Notes: Scrolls battle information around the character model.
## IconTexture: Interface\AddOns\MikScrollingBattleText\Artwork\MinimapIcon
## SavedVariables: MSBTProfiles_SavedVars, MSBT_SavedMedia
## SavedVariablesPerCharacter: MSBTProfiles_SavedVarsPerChar
## OptionalDeps: LibSharedMedia-3.0

